# Cloudflare static-assets response headers for the whole site (every page here is
# a static asset). See AGENTS.md "Content Security Policy".
#
# REPORT-ONLY on purpose: violations are logged to the browser console and
# nothing is blocked, so this cannot break a page. Read the console on the
# pages you ship, add what is legitimately needed, then rename the header to
# `Content-Security-Policy` to enforce it.
#
# The two sha256 values are the inline scripts <Head /> emits (the colour-scheme
# bootstrap and the consent-gate stub). They change only when
# @getvitops/astro changes those scripts; regenerate with
#   vp exec node -e "import('@getvitops/astro').then(m => console.log(m.contentSecurityPolicy()))"
# `templates.test.ts` in the toolchain repo guards that they match.
#
# Third-party tags the consent gate activates need their origins in
# script-src/connect-src before you enforce, and an INLINE tag body (Google's
# `gtag('config', …)`, Matomo's `_paq`, Clarity's loader) needs its own 'sha256-…' in
# script-src too: the gate re-creates it as a new script, so the origin alone is not enough.
# The console report prints the exact value to add.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security has no `includeSubDomains` or `preload` on purpose: those
# commit every subdomain of the site's domain to HTTPS and are hard to take back.
# Add them deliberately once every subdomain is known to serve HTTPS.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'sha256-CEiVlTo192T9Rug/nAl+ihvkqOQkYdr6Rq3oc+gR9JU=' 'sha256-z/UqsITVvNGOJSaOSvhN1rdtyYdMIxpQ/lMXM1q0g90=' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin-allow-popups
